{
  "id": "fluency-l8-clearing-fractions",
  "course": "equations",
  "lesson": "l8-clearing-fractions",
  "title": "Fluency: clearing fractions",
  "n": 20,
  "pass": 0.9,
  "minutes": 10,
  "families": [
    {
      "id": "two-fractions-sum",
      "skill": "clear two fractions",
      "vars": {
        "p": { "int": [2, 5] },
        "q": { "int": [3, 6] },
        "k": { "int": [-4, 5], "not": [0] },
        "v": { "pick": ["x", "n", "y", "t"] }
      },
      "let": { "lcd": "lcm(p, q)", "x0": "k*lcm(p, q)", "r": "k*lcm(p, q)/p + k*lcm(p, q)/q", "u": "lcm(p, q)/p", "w": "lcm(p, q)/q", "lr": "lcm(p, q)*(k*lcm(p, q)/p + k*lcm(p, q)/q)" },
      "where": ["p < q"],
      "prompt": "Solve $\\dfrac{{{v}}}{{{p}}} + \\dfrac{{{v}}}{{{q}}} = {r}$.",
      "widget": { "kind": "numeric", "answer": "{x0}", "tol": { "abs": 0 }, "label": "{v}", "placeholder": "use − for below zero" },
      "wrong": [
        { "id": "right-side-missed", "value": "{r/(u + w)}", "tol": { "abs": 0.01 }, "line": "Multiply every term by ${lcd}$, the ${r}$ on the right as well." },
        { "id": "added-bottoms", "value": "{r*(p + q)}", "tol": { "abs": 0.01 }, "line": "You added the bottoms; $\\dfrac{{{v}}}{{{p}}} + \\dfrac{{{v}}}{{{q}}}$ is not $\\dfrac{{{v}}}{{{p + q}}}$." }
      ],
      "solution": [
        "Multiply every term by ${lcd}$, the lowest common denominator: ${u:c}{v} + {w:c}{v} = {lr}$.",
        "So ${u + w}{v} = {lr}$ and ${v} = {lr} \\div {u + w} = {x0}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "whole-tops",
      "skill": "clear fractions with whole tops",
      "vars": {
        "p": { "int": [2, 4] },
        "k": { "int": [2, 3] },
        "m": { "pick": [-2, -1, 1, 2] },
        "x0": { "int": [-6, 9], "not": [0] },
        "v": { "pick": ["x", "n", "y", "t"] }
      },
      "let": { "q": "p + k", "b": "p*m - x0", "d": "(p + k)*m - x0", "qb": "(p + k)*(p*m - x0)", "pd": "p*((p + k)*m - x0)", "rhs": "p*((p + k)*m - x0) - (p + k)*(p*m - x0)" },
      "where": ["q <= 6", "b != 0", "d != 0", "abs(b) <= 12", "abs(d) <= 12", "m != x0", "x0 != (p + q + 1)*m"],
      "prompt": "Solve $\\dfrac{{{v}{b:+}}}{{{p}}} = \\dfrac{{{v}{d:+}}}{{{q}}}$.",
      "widget": { "kind": "numeric", "answer": "{x0}", "tol": { "abs": 0 }, "label": "{v}", "placeholder": "use − for below zero" },
      "wrong": [
        { "id": "lost-bracket", "value": "{m}", "tol": { "abs": 0.01 }, "line": "The top is one block: ${q}({v}{b:+})$, not ${q}{v}{b:+}$." },
        { "id": "own-bottom", "value": "{x0 - (p + q)*m}", "tol": { "abs": 0.01 }, "line": "Multiply both sides by ${p*q}$, so each top is multiplied by the other side's bottom." }
      ],
      "solution": [
        "Multiply both sides by ${p*q}$: ${q}({v}{b:+}) = {p}({v}{d:+})$.",
        "Expand: ${poly(v; q, qb)} = {poly(v; p, pd)}$.",
        "Collect: ${k}{v} = {rhs}$, so ${v} = {rhs} \\div {k} = {x0}$."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
